READ ME
Image Slider Website

This project is a simple website that displays an image slider with three images.
It is created to practice basic web development using HTML, CSS, and Python.

Project Structure

HTMLPage.html – Main HTML file that defines the page structure and image slider.

style.css – CSS file used for layout, positioning, and visual styling of the slider.

foto1.jpg – First image used in the slider.

foto2.jpg – Second image used in the slider.

foto3.jpg – Third image used in the slider.

websiteresult/ – Folder containing output or result files.

mywebsite.py – Python file used to run or serve the website.

mywebsite.sln – Visual Studio solution file.

Features

Image slider with three images

HTML structure for content and layout

CSS styling for design and positioning

Local image usage

Simple and readable project structure

Technologies Used

HTML

CSS

Python
